WEBVTT

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.800
We have now returned to normal space-time.
All warping processes have completed.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.060
We're currently located in the
center of the Alta star system.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.020
We're securing the starway
to the planet Codomos.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.690
This area is totally undefended,

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:17.440
even though it's extremely
close to their mother planet.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.110
So they really don't have a
concept of "our own place..."

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.280
Would you like to lower the alert level?

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.110
There's no need for us to
accommodate ourselves to them.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.450
We'll take our own approach.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:33.250
However, there's no doubt
that this is a noncombat area.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.540
I hope the message that we sent
to our friendly forces will reach them.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.130
No sign of the enemy in the area.
Organ units remain standing by.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.170
Roger.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.630
It is an extremely bold move to head
to our enemy's mother planet alone.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:51.310
But considering this situation, it is obvious
that the princess has made the right decision.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.180
What's going to happen next?

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.640
I feel it.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:00:59.440
I'm sure of it.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.360
It is ahead for sure.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.330
Lecty.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:14.910
Yes, Prome-sama.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.330
Someone is trying to come to where I am.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.420
That is...

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:24.380
The one who is capable of finding
a path even away from the starway.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.300
I'll come to protect you right now

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:26.880
There's no need for you to do that.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.430
But Prome-sama...

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:31.760
I'll send the person my voice.
You just stay there and listen to that.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:37.480
Your voice... You mean you're going
to have a talk with the Tribe of Iron? But...

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:49.700
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:55.950
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:16.180
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:23.190
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.190
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:30.200
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.030
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:35.660
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.240
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:39.910
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:48.760
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:54.010
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.390
<b>With a flower held to my heart,</b>

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:02.640
<b>no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:06.730
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.320
Why are you trying to fight alone?

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.690
Are you trying to drive yourself to madness?

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:54.910
Yuty...

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:18.350
Don't slow down! Shake them off!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.060
Ma'am, we've got a
communication from the Argonaut!

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:28.020
Planet Codomos? Does it mean this
is conciliation rather than surrender?

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.070
Given the time lag of the communication,

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:33.860
the Argonaut should be
reaching Codomos any time now.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:37.570
To think they're jumping into the territory of
the ones who have been trying to destroy us...

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:40.910
No guidance could be bolder than hers.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:43.870
We're changing course!
We will head to planet Codomos!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.040
Entering the coordinates sent by the Argonaut.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.750
It looks like there's still a way...

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.710
I feel it.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.050
They are waiting for us.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.220
This could be a trap...

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.100
I don't think so.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:07.600
Dhianeila-sama would like to
see you. Come here right away.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:10.230
To the princess' room?

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.650
I'm here.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.950
Please stand up, Iolaous

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:20.120
This is my princess' room,
and I'm in her presence.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.370
I can't bring myself to do that.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.960
You can't jump with me if
you're saying things like that.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.460
Jump with you, Princess?

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.340
We will land on the Codomos.

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.800
Please reconsider, Dhianeila-sama.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.760
We have no time to waste.

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.930
But going there without
any security would be...

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.980
Iolaous will be with me.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:51.980
I'm going there alone,
and that's the point, Aneasha.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.940
I must reach reconciliation
with them no matter what.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:58.450
Otherwise everyone in
this star system will perish.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.320
Dhianeila-sama...

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.950
I swear to protect the princess with my life.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.330
Iolaous...

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:21.510
Princess, please show me the location.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:30.480
Is my power intimidating your mind, Iolaous?

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.110
No, princess.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.650
Good.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:38.530
I'll show you the place we need to go.

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.490
Can you see that, Iolaous?

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.660
Yes.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.080
We'll go there.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.580
Will their environment be safe for us?

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:56.340
It seems that they have
made arrangements for us.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:06.890
Let's go, while there's still time.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.720
I'll follow your guidance.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:13.810
Captain.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.480
So she left?

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.190
She took Iolaous with her. Just two of them.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:22.900
Don't worry. The princess
has never made a wrong decision.

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:26.240
It is our duty to have faith in her and wait.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.660
Yes.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.620
Princess...

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.000
Big brother...

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:42.510
Please be safe, Dhianeila-sama... Iolaous...

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:51.350
I have been waiting for you.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:54.770
In accordance with
your language, your environment

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:59.440
and your civilization,
let us exchange our thoughts.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:07.870
I could feel that you were
making arrangements for us.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.580
Why did you realize my presence?

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:14.080
Because I felt your feelings.

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:16.170
Were they emotions?

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:19.710
They were deeper and quieter than that.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.220
Prome O has welcomed the Tribe of Iron.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.630
That is a foolish choice.

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:33.270
I am Prome O.
Prome, a member of the O family.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:37.270
Dhianeila Y Leisha Altria Ol Yunos.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.480
Dhianeila, the eldest daughter
of the Yunos royal family

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:42.940
and the principal of the Altria star system.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:51.950
Prome O, would it be all right to
convey our conversation to our ship?

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:56.670
Yes, Dhianeila. My fellow
beings are also listening in.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.670
Thank you for your kindness.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:16.180
We feel that we need to learn more about you.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:19.600
My thoughts are the same.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:22.570
Are you here by yourself?

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:29.740
This is just the birthplace of our civilization.
This place itself doesn't hold any significance.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:35.000
Do you not desire to establish a
civilization based on historic significance?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:40.830
That fixation on one planet is
a notion characteristic of a tribe

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:43.880
that is unable to come
to space on its own power.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.090
You are the only tribe
that has tried to maintain

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:49.840
its historic core, even after coming to space.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:53.640
Or perhaps I should say,
the Tribe of Gold is the only one.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:56.470
The Tribe of Gold?

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.850
Prome O has come in
contact with the Tribe of Iron.

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:02.810
That suggests a possibility of some sort.

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:05.320
This situation is worth reviewing.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.700
This conversation that
Prome is in is a mistake.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:15.240
The presence of the Tribe of Iron
disturbs the order of this universe.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:18.200
She has come without even a weapon.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.710
I agree to let this conversation continue.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:24.040
The Tribe of Iron is a tribe
that's going to perish!

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:26.050
Phaetho O.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:30.470
The one on Codomos right now is the
very person who rules the fifth Nodos!

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:32.220
Talking to her is dangerous!

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:36.260
If Prome doesn't get rid of her,
I will do so myself!

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:40.060
Your emotions are taking you over, Phaetho O.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:45.270
I think we will perish if we
don't destroy the Tribe of Iron!

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:56.370
The enemy's encirclement is falling apart!

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.040
What's going on?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.950
The path to survival is now open!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.420
Head to the area where there's
the least number of enemies.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.250
We will burst through enemy lines!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:09.050
Guide us through, Princess Dhianeila...

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:13.800
More and more voices
are agreeing with Prome.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:17.760
Even we share one common thing.

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:21.770
We both received Nodos from the Tribe of Gold.

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:26.770
I think the intention of the
Tribe of Gold is hidden there.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.940
Intention of the Tribe of Gold?

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:32.950
The agreements of the Nodos
have major inconsistencies.

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:36.780
However, it's impossible that
the Tribe of Gold made a mistake.

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:40.620
Therefore, the current circumstances
are what's creating the inconsistencies,

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:44.170
and perhaps the inconsistencies can
be resolved by our peaceful reconciliation,

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:48.800
and the power of the Tribe
of Gold will be given to us.

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.670
Peaceful reconciliation?

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:53.300
Who would've thought we'd
hear those words from them?

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.800
Just like Dhianeila-sama said...

00:11:55.890 --> 00:12:00.140
It seems that this person is the
best one possible to negotiate with.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:03.020
We want peace as well.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:07.060
We're not trying to take
anything away from you.

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.820
There are some among us who hate you.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:15.610
My fellow beings are debating over
the pros and cons of our discussion.

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:21.790
I feel it. I feel the wonderful spiritual
balance maintained among you all.

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:24.910
That is the power allowing us to
expand through this vast universe.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.920
The scariest thing in the universe is isolation.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.500
In order to endure that,
the sharing of psyches evolved,

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:35.340
and we learned how to entrust all our
emotions to a small group of our people.

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:40.640
However, because of that we abandoned
feelings, which are not to be ignored.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.640
What is that?

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:45.770
A sense of loss coming from the
fact the Tribe of Gold has vanished.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:48.190
A sense of duty to take
over their great guidance

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:51.690
and maintain the order of this universe.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:57.700
Those things have created the notion
that we must destroy the Tribe of Iron.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.330
But why us?

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:07.080
Not only did the Tribe of Gold abandon us,
but they also gave your tribe the power.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.750
Nodos...

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:13.300
For us, who have been trying to learn
everything from the Tribe of Gold,

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.970
it is like a betrayal.

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:22.060
However, emotions are not the only reasons
why we believe that we must destroy you.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:28.270
You're also a savage tribe that would even
destroy a planet that you sought for yourself!

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:36.610
Unlike your tribe and the Tribe of Gold,

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:41.030
we might not have the wisdom
to live in space yet.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:45.200
But who decided that we could never gain it?

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:50.170
Did the Tribe of Gold truly decide that we
should be destroyed because we're immature?

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.090
Of course, my people are also in danger

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:56.260
of causing destruction due
to a conflict of opinions.

00:13:56.340 --> 00:14:03.010
You and I should probably both
learn from the Tribe of Gold...

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:05.640
The danger of causing destruction...

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:10.770
We must learn from the Tribe of Gold...

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:13.150
This is not destruction.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:16.150
It is a war that's necessary to keep order.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.360
I think it is possible to
establish order through dialogue.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:20.740
Let's see what happens.

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:29.830
They have no intention of attacking...

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:34.090
It appears that the enemy attacks have
been weakening at each location as well.

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.460
There's no doubt about it...
It is Princess Dhianeila.

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:42.510
High-energy source believed to be a
Nodos detected! Projecting the visuals.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:47.810
That place is hell.
Considering how powerless we are,

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.480
we'll be destroyed instantly if we enter it.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.480
We have no choice but to leave.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.270
We'll head to the starway of
the planet Codomos immediately.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.280
Age...

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:10.100
We don't know anything about the power of
the Tribe of Gold which you have studied.

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:13.730
But you were born with the knowledge of it.

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:18.940
As proof, you found the
planet Olone with no starway.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.880
Yuty... At this rate she'll go mad!

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:05.030
There are times I experience
mysterious sensations.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:09.820
It feels like all the wishes
of the planets are guiding me...

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:12.790
And at the same time,
it feels like I'm connecting

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:17.870
all the planets which
still don't have starways...

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:21.630
Those are the very truths
which surpass all known before.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:26.010
The things I feel are the truths...?

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:28.800
I have always thought that perhaps we,

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:32.970
who travel through the universe
with the guidance of the stars,

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:38.060
have also been guiding
the stars at the same time.

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:43.480
Starways are the interactions of the planets,
and at the same time their very lives.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:46.900
Starways are born before planets are born...

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:49.660
And vanish before they die.

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:52.780
You understood that intuitively.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:56.160
I also have always thought that...

00:17:56.250 --> 00:18:00.000
Why aren't you afraid to get
separated from the starway?

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:04.960
Because that's the truth
of the words "come forth,"

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:08.670
which the Tribe of Gold once said to us.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:15.140
Stars aren't born only from the various
powers that flow in the universe.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:20.270
The interaction of lives from different
planets can also create starways.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.270
Filling this universe with starways...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:27.690
if that was the objective
of the Tribe of Gold...

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:32.030
They permitted wars with no
boundaries because they thought

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:38.040
that would stimulate the
migration of lives the most.

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:42.420
They would have stopped us if
their power to foresee the future

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:47.300
made them consider our actions
as harmful to the universe.

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:53.140
If there were anything that could be called
a possibility for the universe in our war...

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:56.060
I have already seen it...

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:59.520
On the ruined planet Olone...

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.560
The presence of the Argonaut and me...

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:07.230
...resurrected the starway,
which was thought to be dead.

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:15.070
That's why we met Age.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:17.620
A gravitational disturbance has been detected!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.330
Is that the enemy?

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.380
There's no possibility for the Tribe of Iron!

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:32.050
The time has come for you to
face those emotions, Phaetho O.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:35.090
That is your job, Prome O!

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:40.350
Make sure the shield is at max power!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.700
The majority of us have endorsed Prome O.

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:04.670
Therefore, their dialogue now
represents our collective will.

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:08.590
That thinking is wrong!

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.590
What was that?

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:14.510
The enemy just protected us?

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:17.390
Is this the "possibility"?

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.000
Yuty...

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:56.010
Is there something that can be called a
possibility even in this war, Prome-sama?

00:20:56.090 --> 00:21:00.220
Most of my fellow beings
have endorsed our dialogue.

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:03.470
But the war is still going on.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:16.360
It's because of the ones who agree
with Rom Ror, the ruler of the four Nodos.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:20.570
If the inconsistencies remain,
a collapse will be inevitable.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:25.750
If the five Nodos enter madness,
even we won't be able to stop them.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:31.290
Only the Tribe of Gold
can stop Nodos that are mad.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:35.550
There's a planet where they
first appeared in this universe.

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:41.640
None of us ever paid it any heed,
because it held no value as the beginning.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:45.220
You believe the secret
of their power lies there?

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:50.310
When the Tribe of Gold left,
the planet lost its starway.

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:53.320
All it had left were distant memories.

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:55.110
Memories...

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:01.910
I shall now entrust the
one who guides the planets

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:05.950
beyond the starways with the
memories that I have been governing.

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:19.680
The name of the planet
which only you can find is...

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:24.890
Elysium.

00:22:25.560 --> 00:22:33.730
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:33.820 --> 00:22:41.110
I never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:46.290
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:57.050
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:09.890
I take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:21.110
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:26.410
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:33.040
That I love you

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:40.510
When Kervius in madness mourns,
the world turns into nothingness.

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:45.180
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 22: "The Agreement of Death."
